    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever; energy better</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dental pain or swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea, diarrhea or abdominal pain</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Knee pain on stairs, better with exercises</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness or tingling in the feet</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

